{"unit_id":"Edge-HH__GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness#feature-1","repo":"Edge-HH/GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness","commit":"70cf298b3e187dfda96253d8da6ed657f19adb07","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GrokBot 桌宠的功能「会话状态陪伴」：宠物根据当前会话显示待机、思考或工具工作状态，并呈现运行时间、轮次和步骤。插件挂载后自动订阅当前会话，无需单独操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/store.ts:42-92","src/client/pet.tsx:793-829"]}
{"unit_id":"Edge-HH__GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness#feature-2","repo":"Edge-HH/GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness","commit":"70cf298b3e187dfda96253d8da6ed657f19adb07","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GrokBot 桌宠的功能「拖拽与甩出」：用鼠标移动宠物，快速甩动后它会带惯性飞行，并在屏幕边缘和输入框附近反弹。松开时速度不足则只移动位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/pet.tsx:615-679","src/client/pet.tsx:688-743"]}
{"unit_id":"Edge-HH__GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness#feature-3","repo":"Edge-HH/GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness","commit":"70cf298b3e187dfda96253d8da6ed657f19adb07","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GrokBot 桌宠的功能「外观设置」：在设置页或宠物右键面板中选择颜色、形状、身体部件和配饰，并可改名、切换眼睛跟随或恢复默认；更改保存在浏览器中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/pet.tsx:334-368","src/client/pet.tsx:888-1005","src/client/data.ts:17-73"]}
{"unit_id":"Edge-HH__GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness#feature-4","repo":"Edge-HH/GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness","commit":"70cf298b3e187dfda96253d8da6ed657f19adb07","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GrokBot 桌宠的功能「用量与通知」：对话结束时气泡显示最近一轮上报的 token 数及估算金额，也可在浏览器授权后接收请求开始和完成通知。通知权限与开关由用户控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/pet.tsx:462-480","src/client/pet.tsx:774-788","src/client/pet.tsx:816-829"]}
{"unit_id":"Edge-HH__GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness#caveat-1","repo":"Edge-HH/GrokBot_in_DeepseekHerness","commit":"70cf298b3e187dfda96253d8da6ed657f19adb07","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"GrokBot 桌宠 使用前须知：桌面通知依赖浏览器支持且需用户授权；未授权或浏览器不支持时通知不可用，但宠物本身仍可使用（见 src/client/pet.tsx:109-120）。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/pet.tsx:109-120","src/client/pet.tsx:774-788"]}
